==English==

===Alternative forms===
* [[knockwurst]]

===Etymology===
From the {{etyl|de}} noun {{term|Knackwurst|lang=de}}, itself from {{etyl|de}} {{term|knacken||to crack, crackle|lang=de}} + {{term|Wurst||sausage|lang=de}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A highly seasoned [[scalded]] [[sausage]] made from beef, pork, and fatty tissue similar to a [[frankfurter]], but shorter and thicker.

